OL,3,GNEWSAPoliticians back calls for mayoral
OL,4,Aelection in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are growing calls for the mayoral
OL,7,Felection for Hampshire and the Solent
OL,8,Fto be brought forward to 2027.
OL,10,FDarren Paffey, the Labour MP for
OL,11,FSouthampton Itchen said he had written
OL,12,Fto Prime Minister Andy Burnham saying
OL,13,Fit was necessary for the area "to
OL,14,Freceive the funding that this
OL,15,Fgovernment has promised".
OL,17,FThe call has also been made by some
OL,18,FConservatives, Liberal Democrat and
OL,19,FReform politicians in the area.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
